WEBVTT

00:10:27.942 --> 00:10:31.295
And I ask you, stand with us

00:10:31.295 --> 00:10:35.110
as we create futures without violence

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:39.530
for women and girls and men and boys everywhere.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.692
Thank you very much.

00:10:41.692 --> 00:10:47.803
(Applause)